# Saspar

"Time, unstoppable time … when will my time come to an end?"

A blindfolded gunman of the Order of Chaos who secretly longs to fail.

## Background

Saspar looks like a cold servant of the Order of Chaos, but
underneath he simply doesn't care whether he lives; he quietly
hopes to fail at his work and so be done with existence. His
magic comes from strange enchanted devices rather than study: a
gun that fires spells once loaded with the right bullet, and an
ornate pocket watch that lets him foresee events and head off
danger. He always wears a red sash over his eyes, and nobody
knows whether he's truly blind.

## Character Hooks

The Order of Chaos makes Saspar and Acacia natural enemies for
anyone defending the world from evil -- Fukiko and Auren, whose
backgrounds both feature a vague darkness to be fought, fit
especially well. They can also serve as magical rivals.

* Abilities: Art of Invisibility +3, Attack (Magic Gun) +3, Combat Expert +3, Knowledge (Violin) +4, Quick +3, Sixth Sense +3.

* Weaknesses: Emotionless −2, Focus (Chronos Watch) −1, Hatred (Excessive Noise) −2, Servitude (Chaos) −3, Unique Weakness (Cannot Detect Things Perceptible to Sight Alone) −2, Vulnerability (Holy) −1.

* NPC Type: Heroic | Health: 40 | Endurance: 40 | Defense: 5 | Threat Value (TV): 14

* Attacks:

* Brim Shot: Roll 7 dice | DX 5 | Endurance Cost: 0 (Affinity: Fire; Perks: Accurate x2, Effective, Ranged; Flaws: Activation, Weapon). Calls on the spirit of Phoenix to fire a homing projectile bathed in fire.
* Ise Shot: Roll 5 dice | DX 5 | Endurance Cost: 0 (Affinity: Ice; Perks: Effective, Impairing, Ranged; Flaws: Activation, Weapon). Calls on the spirit of Ymir to fire a frost ray that encapsulates what it hits in ice.
* Lode Shot: Roll 5 dice | DX 5 | Endurance Cost: 0 (Affinity: Earth; Perks: Effective, Ranged, Stunning; Flaws: Activation, Weapon). Calls on the spirit of Gaia to fire a rocky blast that knocks targets off their feet.

